+# Static IPFS Deployment
+
+These commands build and publish the static frontend. They are documented only; this task does not upload anything.
+
+Use Node.js `>=20.18.3`.
+
+## Build
+
+Run this after the target contract deployment metadata is present in `packages/nextjs/contracts/deployedContracts.ts`.
+
+```bash
+yarn install
+NEXT_PUBLIC_IPFS_BUILD=true yarn next:build
+test -f packages/nextjs/out/index.html
+```
+
+Optional local preview of the static output:
+
+```bash
+python3 -m http.server 8080 --directory packages/nextjs/out
+open http://127.0.0.1:8080
+```
+
+## Upload
+
+With a local IPFS/Kubo node:
+
+```bash
+export CID=$(ipfs add -Qr packages/nextjs/out)
+echo $CID
+ipfs pin add $CID
+```
+
+With the existing `bgipfs` dependency instead:
+
+```bash
+cd packages/nextjs
+NEXT_PUBLIC_IPFS_BUILD=true yarn build
+yarn bgipfs upload config init -u https://upload.bgipfs.com
+yarn bgipfs upload out
+```
+
+## Post-Deploy Verification
+
+Set `CID` to the uploaded directory CID.
+
+```bash
+export CID=<uploaded-cid>
+export GATEWAY=https://ipfs.io/ipfs
+
+curl -fsSL "$GATEWAY/$CID/" | grep -q "USDC Tip Jar"
+curl -fsSL "$GATEWAY/$CID/" | grep -q "./_next/"
+curl -I "$GATEWAY/$CID/" | head
+```
+
+Then open the gateway URL, connect a wallet to the configured network, and confirm:
+
+```text
+https://ipfs.io/ipfs/<uploaded-cid>/
+```
+
+- The page loads without missing `_next` assets.
+- The connected wallet is on the expected chain.
+- `USDCTipJar` stats read successfully.
+- Sending a small USDC tip emits a new feed item.
